        "official_en_sha256": "15ee3d5127aad8afacf8f4fd46ef0964781366406130259fcd6a5d06b5e3915e"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そうか……\r\nヴェリアスたちを巻き込んで\r\nパラデイアからここへ飛ばされたわけですね。",
        "official_en": "I see...so it was cast out from Paladia to this location, along with the Sworn Eight.",
        "real_en": "I see... So this land was sent here from Paladia, with the Veritas caught up in it."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
