      "text": {
        "jp": "そうじゃな。\r\n７００年前の戦いの怨念が\r\n今もこの地にへばりついておる。",
        "official_en": "Indeed. The deep hatred emanating from the battle seven hundred years ago still lingers in this land.",
        "real_en": "Yes. The resentment left by the battle seven hundred years ago still clings to this land."
      },
